{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q420394","formula":"C₁₁H₂₈Al₈O₅₁S₈","hill":"C11H28Al8O51S8","elements":["H","C","O","Al","S"],"composition":{"C":11.0,"H":28.0,"O":51.0,"S":8.0,"Al":8.0},"names":{"en":"Sucralfate","ru":"Сукральфат"},"descriptions":{"en":"Sucralfate, sold under various brand names, is a medication used to treat stomach ulcers, gastroesophageal reflux disease (GERD), radiation proctitis, and stomach inflammation and to prevent stress ulcers. Its usefulness in people infected by H. pylori is limited. It is used by mouth (for ulcers of the upper gastrointestinal tract) and rectally (for radiation proctitis).","ru":"Сукральфат, продаваемый под различными торговыми названиями, — лекарственный препарат, который используется для лечения язвы желудка, гастроэзофагеальной рефлюксной болезни (ГЭРБ), лучевого проктита и воспаления желудка, а также для предотвращения стрессовых язв. Его полезность для людей, инфицированных H. pylori, ограничена. Препарат принимают внутрь и применяют ректально."},"fame":22,"pubchemCid":121494085,"mass":1577.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"C([C@@H]1[C@H]([C@@H]([C@H]([C@H](O1)O[C@]2([C@H]([C@@H]([C@H](O2)COS(=O)(=O)O[Al])OS(=O)(=O)O[Al])OS(=O)(=O)O[Al])COS(=O)(=O)O[Al])OS(=O)(=O)O[Al])OS(=O)(=O)O[Al])OS(=O)(=O)O[Al])OS(=O)(=O)O[Al].O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.[Al]","inchikey":"YZPQNHUVIVIUCT-JTJNLBSYSA-F","iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q420394","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sucralfate","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D1%83%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%84%D0%B0%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","ur